# Thrash must band on the WINDOW'S PEAK, not the newest interval (banshee-s4d).
# The original bug: the verdict read GREEN at 24 ops/sec six minutes after an alert
# fired RED at 1706, because de-escalation needs only 2 samples and `value` was the
# newest one. Reverting to the raw rate series reproduces it exactly.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/mod.rs
test: thrash_bands_on_the_window_peak_so_a_storm_in_a_trough_still_reports_red
---OLD---
            windowed_peak(&rates, config.thrash_peak_window_secs)
---NEW---
            rates
